{"slug":"Buildings","title":"Buildings","cats":["All stub articles","Stubs"],"headings":[{"id":"Buildings","text":"Buildings","level":2},{"id":"City[EB]","text":"City[EB]","level":3},{"id":"Factory[EB]","text":"Factory[EB]","level":3},{"id":"Port[EB]","text":"Port[EB]","level":3},{"id":"Defense_Post[EB]","text":"Defense Post[EB]","level":3},{"id":"Missile_Silo[MB]","text":"Missile Silo[MB]","level":3},{"id":"SAM_Launcher[MB]","text":"SAM Launcher[MB]","level":3},{"id":"Warship[B]","text":"Warship[B]","level":3},{"id":"Atom_Bomb[MS]","text":"Atom Bomb[MS]","level":3},{"id":"Hydrogen_Bomb[MS]","text":"Hydrogen Bomb[MS]","level":3},{"id":"MIRV[MS]","text":"MIRV[MS]","level":3},{"id":"Airport","text":"Airport","level":3}],"html":"<div role=\"note\" class=\"metadata plainlinks asbox stub\"><table role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr class=\"noresize\"><td><p class=\"asbox-body\">This article is a stub. You can help the wiki by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"/Buildings\">expanding it</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"navbar plainlinks hlist navbar-mini\"><ul><li class=\"nv-view\"><abbr title=\"View this template\">v</abbr></li><li class=\"nv-talk\"><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\"><abbr title=\"Discuss this template\">t</abbr></span></li><li class=\"nv-edit\"><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\"><abbr title=\"Edit this template\">e</abbr></span></li></ul></div></div><table class=\"box-Update plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content ambox-Update\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/Red_clock.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\"></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article needs to be <b>updated</b>.<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"> Please help update this article to reflect recent events or newly available information.</span>  <span class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">V26.17</span>)</i></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/481px-Build_Menu_-_Higher_resolution.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"481\" height=\"387\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"677\" data-file-height=\"544\"><figcaption>The Build Menu.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Description\">Description</h1></div>\n<p><b>Buildings</b> are build-able items that can be built on individual pixels on the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">game maps.</a>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>You can use the number keys to select a building to build. You could also use ctrl+left-click on the <a href=\"/Maps\" class=\"\" title=\"Map\">map</a>. Some <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">buildings</span> have specific requirements that limit where they can be built. For example, <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">ports</a> must be built near water.\n</p><p>There are four types of <b>Buildings/Buildables:</b> \n</p>\n<ul><li>Military <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Buildings</span><sup>[MB]</sup> (Square shaped, only on land)</li>\n<li>Economic <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Buildings</span><sup>[EB]</sup>(Round Shaped, only on land)</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Boats<sup>[B]</sup>(Round shaped, only on sea)</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Missiles<sup>[MS]</sup>(Triangle shaped, only on land)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Buildings\"><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Buildings</span></h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"City[EB]\"><span id=\"City.5BEB.5D\"></span><a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\"><b>City<sup>[EB]</sup></b></a></h3></div>\n<p>Increases maximum Population By 25,000. \n</p><p>Used to gain more workers and troops. \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Price\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>First\n</td>\n<td>125,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Second\n</td>\n<td>250,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Third\n</td>\n<td>500,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>After\n</td>\n<td>1,000,00\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Factory[EB]\"><span id=\"Factory.5BEB.5D\"></span><a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\"><b>Factory<sup>[EB]</sup></b></a></h3></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/200px-Factory_port_trains.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"149\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"457\" data-file-height=\"340\"><figcaption>Factories and ports connected by trains</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Automatically spawns or connects to Trains and <a href=\"/Railroad\" title=\"Railroad\">Railroads</a> to <a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">trade</a> with other <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">buildings</span>. Once connected, <a href=\"/Train\" title=\"Train\">trains</a> start spawning. <a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">Factory</a> shares pricing with Port.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Price\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>First\n</td>\n<td>125,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Second\n</td>\n<td>250,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Third\n</td>\n<td>500,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>After\n</td>\n<td>1,000,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Port[EB]\"><span id=\"Port.5BEB.5D\"></span><b><a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">Port<sup>[EB]</sup></a></b></h3></div>\n<p>Spawns <a href=\"/Trade_Ship\" title=\"Trade Ship\">trading ships</a> and is necessary to build <a href=\"/Warship\" title=\"Warship\">Warships</a>. <a href=\"/Trade_Ship\" title=\"Trade Ship\">Trade ships</a> sent out make more <a href=\"/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a> the farther they have traveled from their <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">ports</a>. Other players can steal your <a href=\"/Trade_Ship\" title=\"Trade Ship\">trade ships</a>. \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\nPrice\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>First\n</td>\n<td>125,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Second\n</td>\n<td>250,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Third\n</td>\n<td>500,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>After\n</td>\n<td>1,000,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Defense_Post[EB]\"><span id=\"Defense_Post.5BEB.5D\"></span><a href=\"/Defense_Post\" title=\"Defense Post\"><b>Defense Post<sup>[EB]</sup></b></a></h3></div>\n<p><b>Strengthens borders in an area around itself.  A strengthened border is 5 times more difficult to take over in comparison to free land.</b> \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n<b>Price</b>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>First</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>50,000</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Second</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>100,000</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Third</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>150,000</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Fourth</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>200,000</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>After</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>250,000</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Missile_Silo[MB]\"><span id=\"Missile_Silo.5BMB.5D\"></span><a href=\"/Missile_Silo\" title=\"Missile Silo\"><b>Missile Silo<sup>[MB]</sup></b></a></h3></div>\n<p>Required for launching <a href=\"/Atom_Bomb\" title=\"Atom Bomb\">Atom Bombs</a>, <a href=\"/Hydrogen_Bomb\" title=\"Hydrogen Bomb\">Hydrogen Bombs</a> and <a href=\"/MIRV\" title=\"MIRV\">MIRVs</a>. Launching <a href=\"/Atom_Bomb\" title=\"Atom Bomb\">Atom Bombs</a> and <a href=\"/Hydrogen_Bomb\" title=\"Hydrogen Bomb\">Hydrogen Bombs</a> has a cooldown of approximately 10 seconds. Launching a <a href=\"/MIRV\" title=\"MIRV\">MIRV</a> has no cooldown.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\nPrice\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>All\n</td>\n<td>1,000,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"SAM_Launcher[MB]\"><span id=\"SAM_Launcher.5BMB.5D\"></span><a href=\"/SAM_Launcher\" title=\"SAM Launcher\"><b>SAM Launcher<sup>[MB]</sup></b></a></h3></div>\n<p>Surface-to-air missile launcher, used to destroy incoming missiles.\nIt will target any missile that would land in a 100 pixel radius. It has a 100% chance to destroy an <a href=\"/Atom_Bomb\" title=\"Atom Bomb\">Atom Bomb</a>, 80% chance to destroy a <a href=\"/Hydrogen_Bomb\" title=\"Hydrogen Bomb\">Hydrogen Bomb</a>, and a 50% chance to destroy a <a href=\"/MIRV\" title=\"MIRV\">MIRV</a> warhead. It has a cooldown of 7.5 seconds.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\nPrice\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>First\n</td>\n<td>1,500,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>After\n</td>\n<td>3,000,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Warship[B]\"><span id=\"Warship.5BB.5D\"></span><b><a href=\"/Warship\" title=\"Warship\">Warship<sup>[B]</sup></a></b></h3></div>\n<p>Attacks enemy <a href=\"/Transport_Ship\" title=\"Transport Ship\">transports</a> and enemy <a href=\"/Warship\" title=\"Warship\">Warships</a>. <a href=\"/Warship\" title=\"Warship\">Warships</a> begin with 500HP and grows to a max of 1000HP. Used for defending your territory from, <a href=\"/Warship\" title=\"Warship\">warships</a>, <a href=\"/Transport_Ship\" title=\"Transport Ship\">transport ships</a>, or for stealing other players' <a href=\"/Trade_Ship\" title=\"Trade Ship\">trade ships</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Price\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>First\n</td>\n<td>250,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Second\n</td>\n<td>500,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Third\n</td>\n<td>750,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>After\n</td>\n<td>1,000,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Atom_Bomb[MS]\"><span id=\"Atom_Bomb.5BMS.5D\"></span><b><a href=\"/Atom_Bomb\" title=\"Atom Bomb\">Atom Bomb<sup>[MS]</sup></a></b></h3></div>\n<p>Explodes in a small area. Used for destroying small sections with <a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\">Cities</a>, <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">Ports</a>, <a href=\"/Defense_Post\" title=\"Defense Post\">Defense Posts</a> or <a href=\"/Missile_Silo\" title=\"Missile Silo\">Missile Silos</a> of an enemy. \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\nPrice\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>All\n</td>\n<td>750,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Hydrogen_Bomb[MS]\"><span id=\"Hydrogen_Bomb.5BMS.5D\"></span><b><a href=\"/Hydrogen_Bomb\" title=\"Hydrogen Bomb\">Hydrogen Bomb<sup>[MS]</sup></a></b></h3></div>\n<p>Explodes and destroys anything in a huge area. Great for cases where an enemy has a lot of <a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\">Cities</a>, <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">Ports</a>, <a href=\"/Defense_Post\" title=\"Defense Post\">Defense Posts</a> or <a href=\"/Missile_Silo\" title=\"Missile Silo\">Missile Silos</a> close to each other.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\nPrice\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>All\n</td>\n<td>5,000,000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"MIRV[MS]\"><span id=\"MIRV.5BMS.5D\"></span><b><a href=\"/MIRV\" title=\"MIRV\">MIRV<sup>[MS]</sup></a></b></h3></div>\n<p>Many Atom Bomb sized explosions across the entirety of a selected nation and can harm any other nations.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\nPrice\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1st of game\n</td>\n<td>25,000,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>after\n</td>\n<td>25,000,000 + 15 x number of mirvs already launched\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Planned_or_tested\">Planned or tested</h1></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Airport\">Airport</h3></div>\n<p>Provides a way to <a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">trade</a> in air. Not available in either Openfront.io or Openfront.dev.\n</p><p>It is believed to be cancelled in favor for <a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">Factory</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">Port</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/SAM_Launcher\" title=\"SAM Launcher\">SAM Launcher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\">City</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Defense_Post\" title=\"Defense Post\">Defense Post</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Missile_Silo\" title=\"Missile Silo\">Missile Silo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">Factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Trade\" title=\"Trade\">Trade</a></li></ul>","section":"Buildings"}
